{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be a pioneer as the founder of your very own car company in the 1900's.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your brand become a legacy or forgotten history?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/47da50565b89380de57b896e60df6c64.poster.avif?t=1769254849\" width=1102 height=539 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/47da50565b89380de57b896e60df6c64.webm?t=1769254849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design &amp; Innovation:</strong> Create custom car models\u2014from compact city cars to luxury or sports vehicles. Choose every extras and aesthetic design. Create your own engine or buy a licensed one to powered your cars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/bf7e7b97adcfdca1b87554c34d5ee3f1.webp?t=1769254849\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/bf7e7b97adcfdca1b87554c34d5ee3f1.poster.avif?t=1769254849\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factory Management:</strong> Build and upgrade your factories around the world, manage staff and wages in an evolving world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker_3_?t=1769254849\" /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R&amp;D and Tech Tree:</strong> Invest in research to unlock more than 150 technologies, from engine parts to luxury extras. Stay ahead or fall behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/0a353f94675eadafd11b25cbae578960.webp?t=1769254849\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/extras/0a353f94675eadafd11b25cbae578960.poster.avif?t=1769254849\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global economy: </strong>The world is divided in 20 geographical regions, each one with its own population, wages and car preferences that evolve throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build for car enthusiast, Papercars Tycoon<strong>\u00a0</strong>puts you in control of your very own auto empire...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937770?t=1769254849","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937770?t=1769254849","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/6160a225f654f69424559963002696e1ec445ae7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769254849","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937770/6160a225f654f69424559963002696e1ec445ae7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769254849","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4040490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be a pioneer as the founder of your very own car company in the 1900's.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your brand become a legacy or forgotten history?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"